WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.580
Guile whiffs crouching medium punch beneath the falling Cammy.

2
00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:00.980
Guile advances after the whiffed timing move.

3
00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:01.180
The second dash closes the remaining knockdown spacing.

4
